{
  "id": "MAT.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matthew 11",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass when Jesus had finished commanding his twelve disciples, he departed thence to teach and preach in their cities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now when John heard in the prison the works of the Christ, he sent by his disciples ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and said unto him, Art thou he that cometh, or look we for another? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus answered and said unto them, Go and tell John the things which ye hear and see: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the blind receive their sight, and the lame walk, the lepers are cleansed, and the deaf hear, and the dead are raised up, and the poor have good tidings preached to them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And blessed is he, whosoever shall find no occasion of stumbling in me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And as these went their way, Jesus began to say unto the multitudes concerning John, What went ye out into the wilderness to behold? a reed shaken with the wind? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But what went ye out to see? a man clothed in soft ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "? Behold, they that wear soft ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " are in kings’ houses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But wherefore went ye out? to see a prophet? Yea, I say unto you, and much more than a prophet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is he, of whom it is written,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then began he to upbraid the cities wherein most of his mighty works were done, because they repented not. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woe unto thee, Chorazin! woe unto thee, Bethsaida! for if the mighty works had been done in Tyre and Sidon which were done in you, they would have repented long ago in sackcloth and ashes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I say unto you, it shall be more tolerable for Tyre and Sidon in the day of judgment, than for you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou, Capernaum, shalt thou be exalted unto heaven? thou shalt go down unto Hades: for if the mighty works had been done in Sodom which were done in thee, it would have remained until this day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I say unto you that it shall be more tolerable for the land of Sodom in the day of judgment, than for thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that season Jesus answered and said, I thank thee, O Father, Lord of heaven and earth, that thou didst hide these things from the wise and understanding, and didst reveal them unto babes: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yea, Father, for so it was well-pleasing in thy sight. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All things have been delivered unto me of my Father: and no one knoweth the Son, save the Father; neither doth any know the Father, save the Son, and he to whomsoever the Son willeth to reveal ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come unto me, all ye that labor and are heavy laden, and I will give you rest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take my yoke upon you, and learn of me; for I am meek and lowly in heart: and ye shall find rest unto your souls. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For my yoke is easy, and my burden is light.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "MAT.12",
    "number": "12",
    "bookId": "MAT"
  },
